<title>USA: Rawlings ends talks on acquiring Daignault.</title>
<headline>Rawlings ends talks on acquiring Daignault.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rawlings Sporting Goods Co Inc said on Tuesday it terminated its discussions about the possible acquisition of Daignault Rolland Cie Ltee, a Montreal-based hockey and baseball equipment supplier.</p>
<p>But Rawlings said it still is strongly considering using Daignault as a supplier of protective hockey equipment.</p>
